<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχρηστ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be serviceable</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> for a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.18.3
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.39.5
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> to a person, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				618.13
			</span></i> (Heraclea ad Latm., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>): abs., <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.184
			</span></i>, Diog.Bab.ib. <i><span class="en">
				3.233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Michel</u>
				163.22
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lend, advance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				123.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
				108.109
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχρηστεῖσθαι διά τινα</span>
			<i>to receive assistance</i> through his means, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.185e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be in common use</i>, of words, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				964.21
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
